task-mesh (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial development release (v0.1.0 scope): USB serial discovery with
    by-id preference and device picker, connection state machine with
    backoff, watchdog and hot-plug, live node table, SQLite (WAL) storage.
  * Bundles meshtastic 2.7.11 (hash-pinned wheel).

